# Uploaded by `vercel deploy` from this machine — keep secrets and local-only files out.

# Secrets. The public deployment runs WITHOUT an Anthropic key on purpose:
# visitors must not spend the owner's credit, and there is no rate limit yet (M6).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output and caches, rebuilt on Vercel
node_modules
.next
out
build
.cache
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local tooling and notes, not part of the app
.claude
Claude outputs
tests
playwright-report
test-results
*.png
!public/**/*.png
